    "sourceNotes": "The joint degree combines interdisciplinary Ancient Studies with one required specialisation. This example selects Ancient History, the broad historical direction and first-listed specialisation in the adopted regulations, before considering UCR. It includes Classical Mythology and Seminar Ancient History as the two orientation choices, five named specialisation courses, 30 EC open space and a 12 EC thesis including the thesis colloquium. All three years total 60 EC.",
